SUMMARY:MARGRO — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: MAREX GROUP PLC (MARGRO)\nRoadshow: DIRECT LINK: www.netroadshow.c
 om/nrs/home/#!/?show=d075eeca (Recommended) OR Visit www.netroadshow.com a
 nd enter the entry code: Zeus_26 (not case-sensitive)\n\nDeal context:\nMa
 rex Group plc (MARGRO)\, a UK-based financial services firm rated BBB- (St
 able) by S&P and BBB- (Positive) by Fitch at the issuer level\, is launchi
 ng a Reg S USD Benchmark Perpetual Non-Call 6.5-year hybrid offering with 
 expected ratings of BB/BB (S&P/Fitch)\, mandating Barclays\, Goldman Sachs
  International\, and Jefferies as Joint Bookrunners following a series of 
 fixed income investor calls commencing June 1\, 2026. The hybrid structure
  is accompanied by a concurrent tender offer for Marex's existing USD 100m
 n 13.25% AT1 Notes (ISIN: XS2484112524)\, suggesting the new issuance is i
 ntended to refinance or replace the existing capital instrument.
